---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Kevan Ahlquist - Projects"
  description="Personal projects by Kevan Ahlquist, Principal Software Engineer at Amazon in Minneapolis."
  keywords="Kevan,Ahlquist,fullstack,full-stack,Software,Engineering,Minneapolis,Minnesota"
  ogTitle="Kevan Ahlquist - Projects"
  ogDescription="Personal projects by Kevan Ahlquist."
  ogUrl="https://www.kevanahlquist.com/projects/"
>
    <main>
        <h1>Kevan Ahlquist - Projects</h1>

        <article>
            <h2>UI for Docker</h2>
            <p>
              Web interface for the Docker Remote API. Primary maintainer since Oct. 2014, owner since April 2015, grew from 30k to 3 million downloads, 3900 stars. (AngularJS, Docker, <a href="https://github.com/kevana/ui-for-docker" target="_blank" rel="noopener">code</a>)
            </p>
        </article>

        <article>
            <h2>food-finder</h2>
            <p>
              Food notification service, because finding leftover food from lunch meetings is a Hard Problem™. Built to play around with Express, WebSockets, WebWorkers, Geolocation, and Push notifications. (Express, Sequelize, <a href="https://github.com/kevana/food-finder" target="_blank" rel="noopener">code</a>)
            </p>
        </article>

        <article>
            <h2>Sparrowshots</h2>
            <p>
              Screenshot-sharing service to learn new tools. (Django, Electron, AWS)
            </p>
        </article>

        <article>
            <h2>CorpScores</h2>
            <p>
              Live SMS notifications for drum corps competition scores. Sent out 30k messages in first season. (Flask, <a href="https://github.com/kevana/corpscores" target="_blank" rel="noopener">code</a>)
            </p>
        </article>

        <article>
            <h2>Breaktime</h2>
            <p>
              Android app that helps you structure your study time and avoid distractions. Group project for user interface design graduate course, UMN CSCI 5115 (Android, UX, <a href="https://github.com/kevana/BreakTime" target="_blank" rel="noopener">code</a>)
            </p>
        </article>

        <article>
            <h2>PhoneDusk</h2>
            <p>
              iOS burner-phone app and server that uses Twilio to perform calls, whitelist/blacklist contacts, and 'burn' old numbers. 24 hour hackathon project. (Flask, <a href="https://github.com/kevana/phonedusk-server" target="_blank" rel="noopener">code</a>)
            </p>
        </article>

        <article>
            <h2>OSM Pathfinding</h2>
            <p>
              Visualize pathfinding algorithms using real-world data from the OpenStreetMap project. AI project, UMN CSCI 4511. (Javascript, <a href="https://www.kevanahlquist.com/osm_pathfinding/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">demo</a>, <a href="https://github.com/mplewis/osm-pathfinding" target="_blank" rel="noopener">code</a>)
            </p>
        </article>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
